<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Alaska beats Shell, wins PBA title.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Alaska beats Shell, wins PBA title.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the seventh game of the Philippine Basketball Association second conference finals on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Alaska Milk beat Formula Shell 83-77 (37-32)</p>
<p>(Alaska win best-of-seven series 4-3).</p>
</text>
